  ! Start a git repository in /srv/files-example and take it over?                                                      
                                                                                                                        
  Yes looks at the folder once more and makes the changes listed below only if its list is unchanged.                   
                                                                                                                        
    folder: /srv/files-example                                                                                          
    case: files (files without a repository; a first commit takes the listed files)                                     
    owner: root, group: root, mode: 0755                                                                                
    the service can write it: no                                                                                        
    permissions are set: yes                                                                                            
                                                                                                                        
  Files of the first commit (2)                                                                                         
    demo/.env                                                                                                           
    demo/compose.yaml                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
  Left out (1), recorded only in .git/info/exclude                                                                      
    demo/data: bind-mount (stack demo)                                                                                  
                                                                                                                        
  Stacks (1)                                                                                                            
    demo (folder demo)                                                                                                  
      works: deploy                                                                                                     
